  "details": "VRCSDK3-WORLD-2021.11.08.14.28_Public\n\nThrows Assembly Error:\n```\nIndexOutOfRangeException: Index was outside the bounds of the array.\nVRC.Udon.Editor.ProgramSources.UdonGraphProgram.UI.UdonGraphExtensions.SanitizeVariableName (System.String result) (at Assets/Udon/Editor/ProgramSources/UdonGraphProgram/UI/UdonGraphExtensions.cs:588)\n```\nMake sure `result.Length` is not `0` before accessing `result[0]` in the method: `SanitizeVariableName` of UdonGraphExtensions.cs.\n\nRelated Canny:\n[Compilation breaks when Custom Event Name starts with a Digit](https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-bugs/p/compilation-breaks-when-custom-event-name-starts-with-a-digit)",
